  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 280c4326a059df94fabc20b6d7fee8dc, type: 3}
  m_Name: SCENE1Narration
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  heading: THE CONCORD
  typingSpeed: 0.075
  punctuationPause: 0.65
  voiceTextRatio: 0.95
  pauseGame: 1
  loadSceneOnEnd: 1
  sceneToLoad: SCENE2
  cutscene: {fileID: 0}
  startDialogueOnEnd: 0
  dialogueToStart: {fileID: 0}
  lines:
  - text: Hundreds of planets have succumbed to ruin. Not by natural decay or asteroid
      impacts, but by [shake=0.2][danger]war[/danger][/shake]. Feuds born of arrogance
      leave one empire stripped of resources and picked clean of life, the other
      totally exhausted, left for someone else to prey upon.
    image: {fileID: 0}
    autoProgress: 0
    autoProgressDelay: 2.5
    voiceOver: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 61c89c938cb4d0541bc25c05da0a3f2d, type: 3}
  - text: A premise that seemed very unwise to [item][wave=0.5]Graex Vohnuns[/wave][/item],
      a leader of his own nation. Which is why he used his [danger]power[/danger]
      and [item]wealth[/item] to form an [item][wave=0.75]Interspecies Trade Network[/item][/wave].
      The corporation that controls translation, interplanetary banking, diplomatic
      communications and most importantly the [wave][shake=0.2]Concord[/wave][/shake],
      the treaty that opened trade and travel between species.
    image: {fileID: 0}
    autoProgress: 0
    autoProgressDelay: 2.5
    voiceOver: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 329f3608423c70041a0b3be97bc13311, type: 3}
